portant is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Select the incorrect words in the sentences."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 attempts to submit your answers."}], "type": "post_instructions"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le16ob02re2img08.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le16ob02re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le16ob02re2img08.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le16ob02re2img08.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: How is that guestlist going? How many people are coming?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Sally</span>: Not so good! Looks like only half of them are going to turn up so far. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: Well, we'll give them one more day to reply. Hopefully, everyone will get back to us.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Sally</span>: Yeah, I suppose you're right. It's still early after all. There is one empty spot though!"}, {"time": "18500", "image": "engenn6le16ob02re2img08.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: What do you mean? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Sally</span>: I only sent out 7 invites. We could still have one more guest!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: Are you thinking of someone in particular?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Sally</span>: I don't know ... How about that saxophonist?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: Hmm \u2026 I'm going to have a lot of explaining to do if I invite him.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Sally</span>: Do you think Marco will be jealous? It could just be a platonic friendship, you know?"}, {"time": "38300", "image": "engenn6le16ob02re2img08.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: You're probably right. Besides, he could provide the soundtrack.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Sally</span>: Excellent idea! He'll play a couple of tunes while you dish out the food!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: Speaking of which, our prep starts tomorrow at 2 p.m. I'll need to get a couple of pounds of potatoes, some pork, a few heads of lettuce and more greens.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Sally</span>: What's on your mind?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Vanessa</span>: You'll see ..."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa and Sally Plan a Party"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Come Celebrate with Us"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 16}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe  routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking About Future Actions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use four different tenses to talk about the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>When you talk about a things that are not decided or when you make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future, you use the modal will.</li>  When you ask about intentions, you use going to.</li>  <li>When you talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future, you use the Present Continuous tense.</li>  <li>When you talk about schedules or timetables in the future, you use the Simple Present tense. </li></ul>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We'll give them a couple of days to reply.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Only half of them are going to turn up.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"How many people are coming?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Simple Present tense</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Our prep starts tomorrow at 2 p.m.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Quantifiers and Amounts"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<ul><li>You use quantifiers to talk about the quantity or amount of something.</li><li>  Remember there are general and specific quantifies.</li>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"General Quantifiers\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Specific Quantifiers\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Count Nouns\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" All<br> Most<br> Many<br> Some<br> Any<br> A few<br> A lot of<br> A couple of<br> No\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"All of <br> Most of<br> Many of<br> Some of<br> Any of<br> A few of<br> A lot of (the..)<br> A couple of (the\u2026)<br> None of\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Non-Count Nouns\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"All<br> Some<br> Any<br> A little<br> Much<br> No\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"All of<br> Some of<br> Any of<br> A little<br> Much of\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":13,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Measurements (Nouns)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Amount\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"pound\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" a little less than half a kilogram\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"pint\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" a little less than half a liter \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"quart\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a little less than one liter\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"gallon\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" about three liters and a half \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"dozen\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"12 pieces \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"slice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a cut piece from a whole\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"case\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" a box of 6, 12 or 24 bottles \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"cup\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a little less than \u00bc of a liter \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" tin, jar, can\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"containers \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" a pinch / a dash \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a very small amount \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a teaspoon \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a small measuring spoon\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a tablespoon\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" a large measuring spoon\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'll need to get a couple of pounds of potatoes, some pork, a few heads of lettuce and more greens."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "guestlist "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the list of people you invite for an event "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: How's that guestlist going? How many people are coming?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob02aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to organize a dinner party."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to turn up "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to attend "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Only half of them are going to turn up."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob02aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to get back to someone "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to reply "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Hopefully, everyone will get back to us."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob02aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "a lot of explaining to do "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a difficult situation to explain "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'll have a lot of explaining to do if I invite that saxophonist."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob02aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "platonic "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a close relationship not built on physical intimacy "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It could just be a platonic friendship, you know?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob02aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "soundtrack "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "musical accompaniment to an event or movie "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Your saxophonist friend will provide the soundtrack to the party!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob02aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "greens "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "vegetables "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need a lot of greens for the salad."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob02aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": " lettuce "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a plant with leaves that you use for salads "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'll need to get a few heads of lettuce tomorrow."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob02aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le16ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "With a partner, write a dialogue (10-14 lines) about organizing a party."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write about what kind of party you want to organize."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Think about how many people you want to invite, and how much food you need to prepare."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Offer suggestions and reply to your partner's suggestions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your dialogue aloud."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about what I want to do in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about amounts and quantities."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I offer suggestions and reply to suggestions."}]}]}